{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>למי אוי</b> — as though he warned to beware of wine, or that he calls out 'woe' upon its consequences." "<b>אבוי</b> — a noun from אביון." "<b>למי שיח</b> — strifes." "<b>למי פצעים חנם</b> — that come upon him for nothing." "<b>חכלילות</b> — redness of the eyes, from much drinking of wine."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:23.941014870Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}